🧠 Machine Learning Model

Current forecasting model:

XGBoost Regressor

Forecast horizon:

24 hours

Resolution:

15 minutes

Total forecast steps:

96
⚙️ Feature Engineering

The forecasting model uses several engineered variables, including:

Calendar Features
Hour
Day of week
Month
Weekend indicator
Lag Features
Previous price
24-hour lag
48-hour lag
Weekly lag
Rolling Statistics
Rolling mean
Rolling standard deviation
Weather Variables
Temperature
Wind
Solar-related features (where available)
📈 Model Evaluation

The project includes a complete backtesting framework.

Evaluation metrics include:

Mean Absolute Error (MAE)
Root Mean Squared Error (RMSE)
Mean Absolute Percentage Error (MAPE)
Forecast Bias

Additional monitoring:

Rolling MAE
Error distribution
Largest forecast errors
